Khwaher E Sibte Nabi Jaan E Ali O Zehra<br>
 <br>
Belcha Tujh Ko Laga Yaa Hai Layeen Wavela<br>
 <br>
1. Khudratein Rakh Ke Giraftaar Gayi Hai Zainab<br>
 <br>
Dar Ba Dar Kooncha O Bazaar Gayi Hai Zainab<br>
 <br>
Quld Me Qaakh Udate Hai Ali O Zehra<br>
 <br>
2. Belcha Zainab E Muztar Ko Layeen Ne Maara<br>
 <br>
Haye Bekas Ka Lahoo Behgaya Sar Se Saara<br>
 <br>
Quld Me Qaakh Udaate Hai Ali O Zehra<br>
 <br>
3. Roo Ke Kehte The Ye Sajjad E Hazeen Wavela<br>
 <br>
Kya Phuphi Saath Mera Chod Gayi Wavela<br>
 <br>
Quld Me Qaakh Udate Hai Ali O Zehra